          "comment": "Good second at Leicester in April but below par last twice; bounce back needed",
          "spotlight": "Very useful sprint handicapper on his day, winning a valuable prize at York (6f, soft) last autumn; as good as ever when second at Leicester (6f, good) in April but needs to shrug off below-par efforts on his last two starts.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2024-10-12",
              "horse": "Strike Red",
              "horse_id": "hrs_21669781",
              "race": "Coral Sprint Trophy Handicap (Heritage Handicap)",
              "race_id": "rac_11397971",
              "course": "York",
              "course_id": "crs_2782",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1320",
              "quote": "Strike Red had a bad injury last year that you wouldn't really see on Flat horses and more on jumpers. He's been better than ever this year and this worked out easily enough. I always told Richard [Fahey, trainer] he feels like a Group horse and he's a top-end handicapper. There's plenty still to look forward to - Billy Garritty, jockey."
            },
            {
              "date": "2023-07-22",
              "horse": "Strike Red",
              "horse_id": "hrs_21669781",
              "race": "Paddy Power Scurry Handicap (Premier Handicap)",
              "race_id": "rac_10991708",
              "course": "Curragh",
              "course_id": "crs_4628",
              "distance_f": "6.5",
              "distance_y": "1383",
              "quote": "Strike Red has been a good horse for me. He keeps winning these big handicaps so I'm absolutely delighted. I didn't think Ripon really suited him the last day.  When he gets there he doesn't do a lot. He pricks his earls a little bit - Billy Garritty, rider"
            }
          ],
