              "course_id": "crs_572",
              "distance_f": "5",
              "distance_y": "1107",
              "quote": "I couldn't fault Bergerac, he dug deep and I think the stiff five furlongs really suits him ? he's a yard favourite at home. He was coming off a good run, but I'd be lying if I said I wasn't worried about the ground as he always seems to have form on quicker - Tom Eaves, jockey."
