          "comment": "Five wins since joining Ruth Carr, including at York in June, but below par latest",
          "spotlight": "Fifth win (all under William Pyle) in excellent spell since joining Ruth Carr when seeing off Jonny Concrete in a big field at York (6f, good to firm) last month; does need to bounce back from a lesser run at Thirsk since, though.",
