              "quote": "He arrived here in February in good nick from Iain Jardine's stable looking for a change of scenery having been in the same yard since he was a yearling. He proceeded to rattle off three on the spin at Newcastle twice and then at Southwell by two lengths. His trip is 6f and he likes some give in theound. I'm looking at Thirsk in May next, but things will be more difficult for him off an all-time high mark. Also entered at Newcastle and Thirsk this week. 09-04-25"
