          "comment": "Progressive, winning two novices before seventh of 12 in Royal Ascot Group 3; more to come",
          "spotlight": "Progressive, winning fast-ground novices at Wetherby (1m) and Salisbury (1m2f; by 5l) before advancing his RPR again when seventh (Great David 2l ahead in fifth) of 12 in 1m2f Royal Ascot Group 3; shapes as if this slightly longer trip could suit and open to further improvement.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2025-04-27",
              "horse": "Arabian Force",
              "horse_id": "hrs_51523857",
              "race": "Bet With The On-Course Bookmakers Novice Stakes (GBB Race)",
              "race_id": "rac_11589877",
              "course": "Wetherby",
              "course_id": "crs_2262",
              "distance_f": "8",
              "distance_y": "1760",
              "quote": "At Kempton Arabian Force was very raw and green but he's learned plenty from then. He was a touch slow and I wanted to be on the front end so I've had to ride him quite aggressively early on which probably wasn't ideal but he needed that today to wake him up a little bit. I got a nice breather in him round the bend and had something to aim in the straight and I committed him early as he's going to stay further. He's very tough, we had a challenger on our outside but he knuckled down and, with a bit of ease in the ground and stepping up in trip, you'll see a much better horse. He's only going to progress throughout the year - Cieren Fallon, jockey, speaking to Racing TV."
            }
          ],
