          "comment": "C&D win in May; made all at Ayr 12 days ago and should be competitive under 5lb penalty",
          "spotlight": "C&D win on good in May and got his head back in front when making all in amateur rider handicap at Ayr (5f, good to soft) 12 days ago; should be competitive under a 5lb penalty.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2021-10-06",
              "horse": "Parisiac",
              "horse_id": "hrs_26975095",
              "race": "MansionBet Proud To Support British Racing EBF Novice Stakes (GBB Race)",
              "race_id": "rac_10305568",
              "course": "Nottingham",
              "course_id": "crs_1040",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1338",
              "quote": "Parisiac was a bit keen early on but he finished the race really well. I gave him one backhander and he just went. I ride him everyday at home, he's a bit tricky but the boss gave me the opportunity to ride him and he showed his ability. He'll learn a lot from today - Gianluca Sanna, jockey."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "He's another I bought at the sales and he looks as though he could be quite nicely handicapped if you delve into his form. He appears to like a bit of soft ground and I hope the change of scenery might rekindle some of what he once had. I'm not sure he was suited by Hamilton on his first run for us and we may try him on a flat track. I'm sure he'll win races for us. He looks quick but sees 6f out well. 26-07-24"
            }
          ],
