          "comment": "On workable mark but he's not easy to predict and drying ground would be a major concern",
          "spotlight": "Has registered most of his wins on soft/heavy; on workable mark but he was well held at a big price on Carlisle reappearance (bled from nose) in May; now drops back in grade but he's not easy to predict and drying ground would be a major concern.",
