              "course_id": "crs_1222",
              "distance_f": "5",
              "distance_y": "1100",
              "quote": "In the middle of the summer Impressor had a couple of near misses, he nudged up a couple of pounds and then had a couple of poor efforts. We thought maybe his chance was gone, but he does like the ground and still seems quite well in himself - Phillip Makin, trainer, speaking to Racing TV."
