              "distance_y": "1100",
              "quote": "That wasn't ideal. We wanted to take a lead but Catch Cunningham jumped well and no-one wanted to go on. We reverted to plan B and that's hard to do here. But he's very game and genuine. He'll be better in a better race -  Kevin Ryan, trainer."
