          "comment": "Better strike-rate on AW; chance if transferring earlier 2025 form back to turf.",
          "spotlight": "Well held off 5lb lower when last tried on grass in the autumn; all a case of whether enough of his consistent form in AW 7f contests earlier in the year can be carried back across to turf, where he's 2-22 (versus 10-50 on AW).",
