          "comment": "Twice went close over 7f at Doncaster last month; this drop back to 6f won't be a problem",
          "spotlight": "Close second on consecutive appearances at Doncaster (7f, good to firm) last month and has now performed well on all four starts this season; this drop back to 6f won't be a problem; obvious contender.",
