            {
              "quote": "We paid 50,000gns for him around this time last year but he hasn't run for us yet. He was working very well in the spring and then had a little setback just as he was ready to run. He had some strong maiden form in Ireland when he was trained by Dermot Weld and he's definitely well handicapped. He runs at Redcar on Wednesday and it might take him a run or two to get back after his long time off. He'd be one to follow as I'm pretty sure there's mileage in his mark. 26-09-24"
            }
