          "spotlight": "Not put off by a bump by Golden Duke when beating him by a neck over C&D last month (good to firm), a season's best form effort; will do well to get the same nice run up the inner from tonight's wider draw, but still on a winning mark despite the re-raise and must enter calculations.",
