              "distance_f": "12",
              "distance_y": "2680",
              "quote": "When Beauparc is right, she's a nice filly. The last day she ran disappointingly. I thought she might be in season, but we found nothing wrong. Maybe the track in Sligo just didn't suit her and maybe the ground was too watered. She's done her job today anyway, that's three she's won now. The lads would like to go to Galway so that'll probably be the next stop. She probably won't run before that and she seems to run better fresh so she might take her chance in the mile and a-half premier handicap there - Gerard Keane, trainer."
