          "comment": "Left previous form behind with 125-1 2nd at Cork before Tipperary win; fair mark",
          "spotlight": "Left all previous form behind when a 125-1 runner-up at Cork behind a nice prospect and confirmed that promise when justifying favouritism in a Tipperary maiden hurdle in May; fair mark for handicap debut but hasn't shown anything in two heavy ground runs so may need the rain to stay away.",
