          "comment": "Won a Sligo claiming hurdle last month but was since well beaten in a Tipperary chase",
          "spotlight": "Six wins under all codes; won a Sligo claiming hurdle last month but was since well beaten in a Tipperary chase behind some of these and has to bounce back.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2023-12-09",
              "horse": "Embittered",
              "horse_id": "hrs_13772850",
              "race": "Foxrock Handicap Chase (Listed Race)",
              "race_id": "rac_11131081",
              "course": "Navan",
              "course_id": "crs_5018",
              "distance_f": "20.5",
              "distance_y": "4500",
              "quote": "I thought Embittered won well and it was a nice pot. He had a nice run the last day in Cork, we were delighted with it, and he did it well there today. Carl [Millar] is good value for 7lb. I've no real plan for him, we'll try and find something similar - Gordon Elliott, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2021-10-13",
              "horse": "Embittered",
              "horse_id": "hrs_13772850",
              "race": "Extra Places Everyday At BetVictor Novice Chase (Grade 3)",
              "race_id": "rac_10341019",
              "course": "Punchestown",
              "course_id": "crs_5070",
              "distance_f": "18.5",
              "distance_y": "4100",
              "quote": "The extra couple of furlongs helped Embittered. Maybe Roscommon was a bit sharp for him and they got him out of his comfort zone halfway round. Bryan feels something like the Clonmel Oil Chase could suit him. We'll leave that to Eddie, Michael and Joseph, but something like that could suit him. He jumped lovely and I thought he won the race by taking on Exit Poll a long way out. He jumped beautifully the whole way. He tends to jump left at times but he jumped well the whole way. Bryan gave him a lovely ride and suited him well - Brendan Powell, assistant trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2019-11-09",
              "horse": "Embittered",
              "horse_id": "hrs_13772850",
              "race": "Irish Stallion Owners EBF Maiden Hurdle",
              "race_id": "rac_9676589",
              "course": "Naas",
              "course_id": "crs_4992",
              "distance_f": "16",
              "distance_y": "3520",
              "quote": "Embittered was a decent bumper horse but he was a little bit keen in his bumpers and we've been working on getting him settled. He jumped well and saw it out well. He's in the Royal Bond and it would make sense to go there - Joseph O'Brien, trainer."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "Had some good form as a novice chaser and he will belt away in handicaps. Hopefully he can pick one up somewhere along the line. 24-10-23"
            }
          ],
