          "comment": "Dual purpose sort just denied at Royal Ascot last time; fine Cheltenham h'cap chase run",
          "spotlight": "Dual purpose sort won a juvenile hurdle at this track and took the Galway Hurdle last year; was just denied in a valuable staying handicap at Royal Ascot last time; yet to win over fences in four starts but posted his best effort when fourth in a Cheltenham Festival novices' h'cap; tough to beat.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2025-06-17",
              "horse": "Nurburgring",
              "horse_id": "hrs_32180351",
              "race": "Ascot Stakes (Heritage Handicap) (GBBPlus Race)",
              "race_id": "rac_11649625",
              "course": "Ascot",
              "course_id": "crs_52",
              "distance_f": "20",
              "distance_y": "4390",
              "quote": "Massive run, got across from a wide draw, travelled round lovely. When the winner quickened by us, Nurburgring just lacked a gear for a stride or two - maybe another couple of strides and he might have got back at him - Colin Keane, jockey."
            },
            {
              "date": "2024-08-01",
              "horse": "Nurburgring",
              "horse_id": "hrs_32180351",
              "race": "Guinness Galway Hurdle Handicap (Grade 3)",
              "race_id": "rac_11353706",
              "course": "Galway",
              "course_id": "crs_4758",
              "distance_f": "16",
              "distance_y": "3531",
              "quote": "When Nurburgring ran well at Punchestown, we decided this was a good mid-summer target. He had a little holiday and then had a nice run over a shortish trip on the Flat at Leopardstown to blow the cobwebs away - Joseph O'Brien, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2023-12-03",
              "horse": "Nurburgring",
              "horse_id": "hrs_32180351",
              "race": "Bar One Racing \"Price Boosts Across All Channels\" Juvenile Hurdle (Grade 3)",
              "race_id": "rac_11125881",
              "course": "Fairyhouse",
              "course_id": "crs_4732",
              "distance_f": "16",
              "distance_y": "3520",
              "quote": "Nurburgring had been gelded since his last run. He travelled like a dream and jumped well. He had a little look around him after the last but he did it well - Richie Deegan, rider."
            },
            {
              "date": "2023-08-25",
              "horse": "Nurburgring",
              "horse_id": "hrs_32180351",
              "race": "Larkin's Bar & Francie Sheahan's Bar 3-Y-O Maiden Hurdle",
              "race_id": "rac_11026574",
              "course": "Killarney",
              "course_id": "crs_4810",
              "distance_f": "17",
              "distance_y": "3740",
              "quote": "Nurburgring was a bit careful but he should improve. With his Flat rating we were hoping he could do that. He coped with the ground well. We'll probably try to find a winners-of-one for him - JJ Slevin, jockey, speaking on Racing TV."
            },
            {
              "date": "2023-04-22",
              "horse": "Nurburgring",
              "horse_id": "hrs_32180351",
              "race": "Racing Next On Saturday May 13th Maiden",
              "race_id": "rac_10906883",
              "course": "Navan",
              "course_id": "crs_5018",
              "distance_f": "13",
              "distance_y": "2860",
              "quote": "Some of mine have needed a run this year and I thought he might get a bit tired, but he came home well. He is a big horse with a lot of scope and is a smart type. He will be a lovely middle distance/stayer hopefully. Joseph O'Brien - trainer."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "He's had one run on the Flat recently having previously competed over jumps and he'll love the step up in distance. 13-06-25"
            },
            {
              "quote": "He'll probably go to Fairyhouse for a juvenile hurdle. He obviously lost the race in the stewards' room at Listowel but the form of that race has worked out well. He's a lovely, big horse and he seems to have taken well to hurdling. He has been gelded since Listowel. 27-11-23"
            }
          ],
